      "label": "remote-session.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
      "fileCategory": "code",
      "sizeLines": 420,
      "summary": "RemoteSession 类的核心实现——管理客户端与服务器会话的完整生命周期，包括打开、创建、提交、中止、模型设置、思考级别设置、重连和销毁操作。通过状态机模式维护 unbound → ready → busy → disposed 生命周期转换，使用订阅者模式通知状态变更。",
      "keyExports": ["RemoteSession", "RemoteSessionState", "RemoteSessionLifecycle", "RemoteSessionOperation", "CreateRemoteSessionOptions"]
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/coding-agent/src/client/transcript.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "transcript.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
      "fileCategory": "code",
      "sizeLines": 101,
      "summary": "Transcript 状态管理模块——提供不可变的 transcript 状态投影机制，将权威快照与流式进度增量合并。处理文本 delta、思考 delta、工具调用参数流式解析，以及 item 生命周期事件。",
      "keyExports": ["TranscriptState", "createTranscriptState", "applyTranscriptSnapshot", "applyTranscriptProgress", "selectTranscript"]
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/coding-agent/test/client/remote-session-lifecycle.test.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "remote-session-lifecycle.test.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
      "fileCategory": "code",
      "sizeLines": 190,
      "summary": "RemoteSession 生命周期测试——验证会话替换时的 attach-before-detach 顺序、替换期间的互斥锁定、当服务器端会话变为活跃时的回滚行为，以及 dispose 对 reconnect 附件清理的等待语义。",
      "keyExports": []
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/coding-agent/test/client/remote-session-ownership.test.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "remote-session-ownership.test.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
      "fileCategory": "code",
      "sizeLines": 174,
      "summary": "RemoteSession 所有权测试——验证工厂方法打开/创建会话、dispose 的幂等性与清理失败处理、独占协调器与共享租约的冲突检测、多会话共享单一客户端的独立性，以及客户端先销毁时的会话释放语义。",
      "keyExports": []
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/coding-agent/test/client/remote-session.test.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "remote-session.test.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
      "fileCategory": "code",
      "sizeLines": 196,
      "summary": "RemoteSession 操作测试——验证流式进度投影不修改权威快照、session_removed 后的 unbound 状态与重新打开、submit 期间的 operation 暴露、turn 阶段的 steer 路由、abort 抢占、操作冲突拒绝，以及订阅者错误隔离。",
      "keyExports": []
    },
    {
